@startuml lld-us10-sequence
title LLD-US10 Get a statement for a date range: sequence diagram
skinparam monochrome true
autonumber
participant Browser
participant StatementController
participant RangeValidator
participant StatementService
Browser -> StatementController : GET /statement?from&to
StatementController -> RangeValidator : check()
StatementController -> StatementService : query()
StatementController --> Browser : page 1 of rows
@enduml